"NSCameraUsageDescription" = "goback . uses your camera to capture your special moments to share with your circle. You'll be able to take photos and record videos directly from the app.";
"NSMicrophoneUsageDescription" = "goback . uses your microphone to record audio for your videos, making your memories even more vivid and authentic.";
"NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription" = "goback . accesses your photo library to let you choose and share your favorite memories with your closest friends.";
